• As an operator (20 years in retail, last role Country Head B2B & CX Lead at Metro AG Pakistan), I saw CX fail 
to earn boardroom trust.
• As a SaaS consultant (5 years in a VoC tech company), I saw dashboards and NPS scores turn into commentary 
