Every enterprise today is drowning in feedback but starving for direction. They have data, but no atomic unit. They have dashboards, but no orchestration. 
They repeat fixes because memory lives in people, not systems. Decipher redeems CX into infrastructure. It operationalizes customer emotion as the most 
reliable, repeatable substrate of change.

